   209 				; Wipe the selector description cache ($037000-$03EFFF = NFO_NAME_VRAM, banks
   210 				; $37-$3E) to $00, marking every image slot "not loaded".  Constant-source fast
   211 				; fill (And 0 -> source is the $00 Xor mask, no fetch).  256 bytes/row * 128
   212 				; rows = 32768 = 8 banks.  Kicked by Nfo_Name_ClearCache from Rescan_Images.
