   806 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   807 				; Load_Menu_Banner_Raw - boot-time load of the static menu banner pixel data
   808 				; (D:MENU.RAW - the logo) into dedicated, resident VRAM - never touched by Load_Image,
   809 				; and never reloaded from disk again after this one call, since the banner
   810 				; never changes at runtime.  Blank-fills any banner target whose file is
   811 				; missing/fails so cold-boot VRAM garbage is never shown.  The separator has
   812 				; no disk file - its 160-byte pattern table is assembly-embedded straight into
   813 				; MENU_SEP_VRAM at load time (Load_Menu_Sep, init_vbxe.asm).  The banner's palette (registers 1-3) is no longer a disk
   814 				; asset - see Load_Menu_Ramps (init_vbxe.asm), assembly-embedded directly into
