  1077 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1078 				; Nfo_Name_Emit - the slot Nfo_Name_MapSlot just mapped (at Ptr_Lo/Hi) in.
  1079 				; Leaves Nfo_Name_Line[0..NFO_NAME_CAP-1] = the name (or all spaces if the
  1080 				; slot byte 0 is < $21, i.e. "no name") + Nfo_Name_Line[NFO_NAME_CAP] = $00.
  1081 				; Window unmapped on return.
  1082 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
