  2232 				; banner on row 0, the section's rows Help_Top .. Help_Top+HELP_VISROWS-1 on
  2233 				; rows 1-19, "Section  n of 3" on row 20 (footer band), the Nav hint on row
  2234 				; 22.  A section's text is a run of $00-terminated rows (an empty one = a
  2235 				; blank row) ended by $FF.  Walks every row, leaving the total in
  2236 				; Help_RowCount for the scroll clamp in Help_Keys.
  2237 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  2238 5C1F			Help_Draw
  2239 5C1F 20 EB 3B			jsr Text_Clear						; wipe the previous screen / section
  2240 5C22 20 78 56			jsr UI_Pen_Normal
